{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id36473479"}, "name":{"label":"Spice Jay"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-12T05:28:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"9388227308"}, "title":{"label":"Wow"}, "content":{"label":"Needed this so badly. Thank you for making this app. It’s ironic that I found out about it through an Instagram ad. But yeah thank you for real", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id395941784"}, "name":{"label":"Kiranuka"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-30T15:43:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"9346829917"}, "title":{"label":"Legitimately Life Changing"}, "content":{"label":"One sec says it's saved me hours in a few weeks, but it only counts preventing an open as saving 3 minutes. With how I was spending time on my app vices before the app, I know I've gotten back LITERAL DAYS of my precious mortal life. Premium is more than worth it and I appreciate a non-subscription model. I do wish very much that I could set multiple time spans for the \"back to reality\" reminders. 3 minutes is fine for instagram, but way too short for YouTube, for example. And once I ignore the first reminder, there's nothing else ever until I leave the app again on my own. If I could have reminders at 3, 5, 10 and 30 minutes, for example, the accountability would continue, and it would seem like a simple add to the app's functionality. Even better would be different reminder times for different apps, but just being able to pick more than one time span would be spectacular and help with the last issue I'm dealing with in app usage.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id326626477"}, "name":{"label":"likethedream"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-26T09:16:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"9331613384"}, "title":{"label":"App switching"}, "content":{"label":"App switching isn’t free which pretty much eliminates the entire point. Thought I’d be able to use this for free with only instagram but no I was wrong and am disappointed yet again. I know it costs money to make apps but you should at least make it usable for free. Would have given 4 stars but Im giving 2 because it’s nearly impossible to use without paying.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id662411486"}, "name":{"label":"JazmineBK"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-24T13:03:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"9324861418"}, "title":{"label":"Love the app But waiting on premium because…"}, "content":{"label":"Love this app, 9/10 times when i’m opening instagram without meaning too (out of habit/boredom,etc) I don’t want to sit through the 6 seconds and close it. Awesome!!! Does what it’s supposed to do. \n\nHowever the one fault I have noticed (and not really a problem with the app but more with me) and the reason I’m not buying premium yet; is that when I do have the app open (either from that 1/10 time where I did sit through, Or I had opened the app with the intent to respond to a message etc), I think subconsciously I will spend longer on the app then I need to because I already have it open and I know how long it takes to open so I don’t wanna have to wait and reopen it later so instead I just stay on it? So when I it stops me from opening it works, but once I have it open I think I stay on longer (kinda like revenge scrolling).\n\nAgain an issue with me not the app! If there was some way to mitigate this issue I would definitely be purchasing premium! Maybe the an option to have the app force close every few minutes? Or when you turn off your phone the app makes you redo the wait screen time? I’m not sure! \n\nBut a fantastic app thank you:)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"13"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"14"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1227692746"}, "name":{"label":"Benny P HHH"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-22T14:17:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9318074094"}, "title":{"label":"Works amazing and makes me feel like crap but also like I’m improving myself"}, "content":{"label":"Really just throws your social media addiction in your face. I guess that’s exactly what I wanted but damn", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id365341967"}, "name":{"label":"nikkismind"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-17T13:22:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9299959501"}, "title":{"label":"Actually helps me think about what I’m doing!"}, "content":{"label":"Cute that this app thinks it’s only saving me 3 minutes when it blocks me from opening TikTok 😅😅\n\nBut seriously, I love that this app makes me take a few seconds to actually think about if I want to open the app and not just compulsively tap on it every time I glance at my phone!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id127818303"}, "name":{"label":"Lifetime88"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-16T07:29:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9295739664"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointing Onboarding"}, "content":{"label":"It took me 15 minutes to set up the automations, and then get the “1 app only” freemium prompt. \n\nHow am I supposed to make a decision between the premium options if I’ve never used the app before?\n\nWould’ve been great to make that choice before setting things up. It felt like the setup was designed to force me into premium.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id483690053"}, "name":{"label":"El_Gab0"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-13T15:48:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9287001854"}, "title":{"label":"Overall great"}, "content":{"label":"This app has really helped me reduce my screentime on instagram. I feel like the quick switching feature should be free though.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id106003268"}, "name":{"label":"oceaniaofclouds"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-09T18:58:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9273263924"}, "title":{"label":"This is what I was looking for"}, "content":{"label":"I have been struggling with social media app and phone addiction for a while and would routinely pick up my phone at the slightest provocation (usually when stressed). This app is simple but very effective and after using it for just 24hrs I bought an annual subscription. I’ve already cut my phone and app usage down very noticeably and it frees me up to actually do things I enjoy and want to do instead of defaulting to doomscrolling. Thank you 💖", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
