{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id186783506"}, "name":{"label":"ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZX"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-04T10:22:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9254778385"}, "title":{"label":"Confusing Setup"}, "content":{"label":"Good concept but couldn’t figure out how to set up. You have to also have the Shortcuts app downloaded.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id441864865"}, "name":{"label":"UNKWSP"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-11-04T07:41:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9254306709"}, "title":{"label":"Curbing Addiction - as long as you pay"}, "content":{"label":"A one app limit with no access to the app-switching protocol while you're able to setup as many apps with both an open and close protocol as you want, only to find it notify you about your limitations when you finally go and open a bad app is not conducive to saving time at all let alone conducive to dealing with zombie scrolling addiction.\n\nAnd let's put aside that the app is really a weak demo with an expensive plan for the real experience, it's not even a one time purchase.\n\nWe can only hope Apple integrated an idea like this internally for a faster and free solution", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
