{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1083062697"}, "name":{"label":"Laridael"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-10-21T08:25:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9207363101"}, "title":{"label":"Just What I Needed!"}, "content":{"label":"My phone addiction has always been a major setback in my academic life, and I’ve tried a wide variety of apps in an attempt to curb it. This app has been a great help to force me to cool my head every time my finger drifts to social media again. Though I tried to apply it to my games and found out that you’d have to pay for pro to unlock it. Someday, someday :,)\n\n All in all, if you are just using it for your social media apps, this is a perfect tool.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-03T16:33:04-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
